  "brief": {
    "zh": "把三封风筝信送到东北角的放飞台。西岛蓝钥匙开中岛和东岛的两个蓝邮袋。东岛的金钥匙开西岛南边的金邮袋。潮汐踏板能放下连接东西航线的两座短桥。限 99 回合。",
    "en": "Deliver all three kite letters to the northeast launch platform. The west island’s blue key opens the blue mailbags on the middle and east islands. The east island’s gold key opens the gold mailbag at the southern tip of the west island. The tide plate lowers two short bridges between the routes. Finish within 99 turns."
  },
